                                                "sense_id": "d716457b-aac3-3771-9cf8-bbde8f45fde2",
                                                "text": "I am sorry to say that I have found it uphill and exasperating work trying to impose Joyce on such “intellectual” people, or people whose opinion carries weight as I know, in London. … There is a strong body of critical Brahminism, destructive and conservative in temper, which will not have Joyce."
